{%- comment -%}
  Cat of the Month: a free-entry prize draw (CAP Code 8.24 — a random draw, not a judged
  competition, so no judging criteria are needed and any cat photo qualifies). Winners are
  blocks — add one only when it's real. The promoter line comes from Theme settings →
  Business & returns; the draw cannot lawfully open until it is filled in.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="wrap">
  <section style="padding-bottom:10px">
    {% render 'breadcrumbs' %}
    <span class="kicker">📸 {{ section.settings.name }}</span>
    <h1 style="margin-top:14px;margin-bottom:.2em">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h1>
    <p class="muted" style="font-size:1.1rem;max-width:62ch">Send us a photo of your cat — in one of our pieces or not. One entry is drawn at random every month and wins <b>{{ section.settings.prize }}</b>. Free to enter, no purchase necessary, and the next round closes <b>{{ section.settings.closes }}</b>.</p>
  </section>
  <section style="padding-top:10px">
    <div class="two">
      <div class="panel"><h3>1 · Take the photo</h3><p style="margin:0">Your cat, in one of our pieces or in nothing at all — every cat photo qualifies. Face clear, in focus, phone photos are fine. Nothing may cover the face or eyes.</p></div>
      <div class="panel"><h3>2 · Send it in</h3><p>Post it and tag <b>{{ section.settings.handle }}</b> on Instagram or TikTok, <i>or</i> email it to <a href="mailto:{{ section.settings.email }}?subject=Cat%20of%20the%20Month">{{ section.settings.email }}</a> with your cat's name and your county. Both routes count the same.</p><p class="small muted" style="margin:0">Entries close at 23:59 UK time on the last day of the month.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="sec-head"><div><h2>Previous winners</h2><p>Every winner gets a frame here, for good — by first name or the cat's name, and county.</p></div></div>
    {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
      {% render 'podium', blocks: section.blocks %}
    {%- else -%}
      <div class="video-slot">No winners yet — the first round closes {{ section.settings.closes }}. Your cat could be the first frame on this wall.</div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </section>
  <section style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="panel terms">
      <h3>Terms</h3>
      <ol>
        <li><b>Promoter:</b> {% if settings.trader_name != blank and settings.trader_address != blank %}{{ settings.trader_name }}, {{ settings.trader_address }}{% else %}{{ section.settings.promoter }}{% endif %}. Open to UK residents aged 18 or over. Not open to the promoter's household.</li>
        <li><b>How to enter, free:</b> post a photo of your cat and tag {{ section.settings.handle }} on Instagram or TikTok, or email the photo to {{ section.settings.email }}. Any photo of a cat qualifies — it does not have to be wearing a {{ shop.name }} product. <b>No purchase is necessary</b>, both routes are treated identically, and one entry per household per round counts.</li>
        <li><b>Rounds:</b> monthly. Each round opens on the 1st and closes at 23:59 UK time on the last day of the month. The next round closes {{ section.settings.closes }} at 23:59.</li>
        <li><b>How the winner is chosen:</b> a <b>random draw</b>. Within {{ section.settings.drawn_within }} days of the close, every eligible entry is numbered and one is drawn at random; the draw is recorded and the record kept for 12 months. Photo quality does not affect the draw. No judging, no votes.</li>
        <li><b>Prize:</b> {{ section.settings.prize }}, sent within {{ section.settings.prize_within }} days of the draw. Credit is valid for 12 months, non-transferable, no cash alternative. One prize per round.</li>
        <li><b>Winner:</b> notified within {{ section.settings.drawn_within }} days of the close by reply on the platform or by email. If we cannot reach the winner within 14 days, a reserve entry is drawn. The winner's first name or the cat's name and their county are published on this page; a winner may object to publication by emailing {{ section.settings.email }}, and we will still give the information to anyone who asks whether the prize was awarded, as the CAP Code requires.</li>
        <li><b>Your photo:</b> by entering you give {{ shop.name }} permission to show the photo on this website and its social accounts, with credit. You keep the copyright and can withdraw the permission at any time by email.</li>
        <li><b>Welfare:</b> entries where the cat looks distressed or restrained are not eligible. Nothing may cover the face or eyes.</li>
        <li><b>Data:</b> names, emails and photos are used only to run the competition and are deleted 12 months after the round closes unless you are a winner shown on this page.{% if shop.privacy_policy.url != blank %} See the <a href="{{ shop.privacy_policy.url }}">privacy policy</a>.{% endif %}</li>
      </ol>
      {%- if page.content != blank -%}<div class="rte">{{ page.content }}</div>{%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Cat of the Month",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "name", "label": "Competition name", "default": "Cat of the Month" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Send us your cat, dressed." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "prize", "label": "Prize", "default": "£25 store credit and a feature on the site" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "closes", "label": "Next round closes", "default": "31 October 2026" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "handle", "label": "Social handle", "default": "@catwalkclub" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "email", "label": "Entry email" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "promoter", "label": "Promoter (used only if Theme settings → Business & returns is empty)", "default": "[promoter's trading name and address — to be added before the first round opens]" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "drawn_within", "label": "Draw held within (days of the close)", "min": 1, "max": 14, "step": 1, "default": 7 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "prize_within", "label": "Prize sent within (days of the draw)", "min": 7, "max": 30, "step": 1, "default": 30 }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    { "type": "winner", "name": "Winner", "settings": [
      { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Photo" },
      { "type": "text", "id": "name", "label": "Cat and county", "default": "Mabel (Leeds)" },
      { "type": "text", "id": "month", "label": "Month", "default": "October 2026" }
    ] }
  ],
  "presets": [ { "name": "Cat of the Month" } ]
}
{% endschema %}
